Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good morning, Leonard. -Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-huh. -We have to stop by Pottery Barn...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上班的途中 我们得先去一下 陶艺生活工坊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:18.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on the way to work. I bought these Star Wars sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:18.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买的这些《星球大战》的床单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They turned out to be much too stimulating to be compatible with a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我太兴奋了 不适合让我好好睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't like the way Darth Vader stares at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢黑武士盯着我看的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:34.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just because your career's been stagnant for a few years, that's no reason to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:33.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算你的事业已经停滞多年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不表示就该放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:38.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I was up all night using the new free-electron laser...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:38.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我整晚没睡 都在用自由电子激光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for my x-ray-diffraction experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做我的X射线衍射实验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did the laser accidentally burn out your retinas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的视网膜 不小心被激光烧毁了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Then you can drive. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -那你就可以开车了 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:48.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LEONARD SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't I tell you I'd be working nights and you'd have to make other arrangements?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是跟你说 我熬夜工作了吗？ 你得自己想办法去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You did. -And?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是说了 -所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:00:58.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:00:58.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:00.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:00.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But how am I going to get to work? -Take the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我怎么去上班？ -坐公车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I can't take the bus. They don't have seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是我再也不能坐公车了 他们没有安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they won't let you lash yourself to the seat with bungee cords.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不让你用弹力绳 把自己绑在座位上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You tried to lash yourself to the seat with bungee cords?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾经想用弹力绳 把自己绑在座位上？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't try, I succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是想 是成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But for some reason, it alarmed the other passengers and I was asked to de-bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道为什么 吓到了其他乘客 我就被赶下车了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're a big boy. You'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个大男孩了 会自己想办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't talk to me like I'm a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要把我当小孩一样跟我讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now take me to return my Star Wars sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在带我去退我的《星球大战》床单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny? Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:42.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for the update.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:42.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:46.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to drive me to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:46.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得载我去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I really don't think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不认为我必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:53.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I don't drive and I can't take the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:53.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我不会开车 又不能搭公车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be fine as long as you don't do that bungee thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会没事的 只要你不要搞那个弹力绳就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:57.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:57.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:01.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't you recently state that you and I are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:01.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最近不是才说我们是朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, Sheldon, we are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是 谢尔顿 我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I hereby invoke what I'm given to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:08.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我在此提出我认知到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is an integral part of the implied covenant of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}隐含在友情的承诺中 一个密不可分的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I didn't realize I was interrupting your morning prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉 没发现 我打扰了你的早晨祷告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:28.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you're done, we'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:28.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等你好了后 我们就走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:56.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for driving me to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:56.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你载我去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know this is my day off, Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道今天我放假 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, I'm not keeping you from anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那很好 我没有妨碍你的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:06.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Your check-engine light is on. -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:06.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的引擎检查灯亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:11.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Typically that's an indicator to, you know, check your engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:11.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一般来说 那是一个 要你检查你的引擎的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's fine. It's been on for like a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事的 它已经亮了大概一个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, that would be all the more reason to, you know, check your engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 那就表示你更应该… 你知道 检查你的引擎了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, it's fine. -If it were fine, the light wouldn't be on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 没事的 -如果没事 灯就不会亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:28.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why the manufacturer installed that light, to let you know it's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:28.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是制造商装这个灯的原因 好让你知道引擎有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:30.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe the light's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:30.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许灯坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there a check-the-check-engine-light light?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有检查引擎检查灯的灯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:42.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Studies have shown that performing tasks such as eating, talking on a phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:42.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}研究显示在开车时 有些行为 例如吃东西、打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or drinking coffee while driving reduces one's reaction time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是喝咖啡会减少反应时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by the same factor as an ounce of alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就跟喝了半两酒一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you have any alcohol? -Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有酒吗？ -当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're going up Euclid Avenue? -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要走欧几里得大道？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard takes Los Robles Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德都走洛罗勃大道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, good for Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Euclid Avenue is shorter as the crow flies, but it has speed bumps...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧几里得大道的直线距离较短 但是它有路面减速区
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which increase point-to-point drive time, making it the less efficient choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会增加定点的开车时间 是比较没有效率的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you have the con.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你比较有优势
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:16.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:21.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're not going to slow down for the speed bumps, I withdraw my objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:21.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 如果你遇到路面减速区 都不减速 我撤回刚刚的结论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's a fun question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一个有趣的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know what the most common street name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道最常见的街道名是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -The answer's tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不知道 -答案很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:32.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Second Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:32.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是第二街
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd think it would be First Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定以为会是第一街
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In most towns, First Street eventually gets renamed to something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但在大部分城镇里 第一街最后都会被重新命名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:40.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like Main Street...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:41.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是主街…百老街
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Broad Street...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:43.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Michigan Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:43.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}密西根大道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard and I often use our commute time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德和我常用上下班的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to exercise our minds with brain teasers like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用这种难题来脑力激荡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We also play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:53.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you like to play one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:53.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想玩玩看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Oh, come on, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不要 -试试看嘛 很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoo! Another bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又一段减速区
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:04.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Uh, I'll say an element and, uh, you say an element...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:04.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我说一个化学元素 然后你说一个化学元素
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whose name starts with the last letter of the one I said, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是开头字母必须跟我讲的 元素的最后一个字母一样 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Helium."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}氦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you could say, "Mercury."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在 你可以说“汞”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would give me a Y.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那表示我得说一个Y开头的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, very clever. That's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真聪明 这个很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I go with "ytterbium"...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我就说“镱”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which gets you back to M.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要接M开头的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you go, "Molybdenum."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你说“钼”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I say, "Magnesium."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我说“镁”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you say, "Manganese."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你说“锰”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I say, "Europium."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说“铕”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're left with "mendelevium."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就只剩下“钔”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:39.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there are no more M's, because I believe that meitnerium...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:39.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后就没有M开头的了 因为我认为“镀”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:43.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...should still be called eka-iridium. So congratulations, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:43.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该还是称为类铱核 所以恭喜 你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you wanna go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要再玩一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about we just have a little quiet time now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我们先安静一下如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:57.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON WHIMPERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I'm finding your reckless nonchalance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉 我觉得你太鲁莽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:05.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...regarding the check-engine light to be very troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:05.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漠视引擎检查灯 让我很烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to tell you that while I do have a theoretical understanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须告诉你 我虽然理论上很了解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of an internal-combustion engine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内部燃烧引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:20.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm not sure I'm capable of performing diagnostics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:20.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不确定我是否可以作检查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said, "Get out."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说“下车”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:41.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Leonard, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:41.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:42.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm ready to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:42.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我准备好要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才刚到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 时间刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:51.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I told you, I only have access to the free-electron laser at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:51.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我跟你说过了 我只能在晚上用自由电子激光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I can't drive you for the next few weeks. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-接下来几星期我都不能载你 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said you couldn't drive me to work. This is from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说你不能载我去上班 现在是下班
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 帮我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, just for the fun of it, I'm gonna take his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 为了好玩 我要站在他这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, how do you propose I get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在 你觉得我该怎么回家？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How did you get here in the first place? -Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是怎么来的？ -佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I sense that's no longer an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我感觉得到 再也不可能有这个选项了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:15.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I need to get to the laser lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:15.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得去激光实验室了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:19.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're just gonna have to find someone else to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:19.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得找别人载你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, damn. I picked the wrong side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真糟糕 我选错边了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCREAMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, not Euclid Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 不要走欧几里得大道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCREAMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why did Howard leave you in the middle of the road, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么霍华德会把你丢在半路上？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We had a difference of opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们意见不合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Over what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whether or not he was trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是不是要杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the record, I maintain he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我郑重声明 他真的这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where are you going? -I'm taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去哪里？ -带你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm not going home. It's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不回家 今天是星期三
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:06.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wednesday is New Comic Book Day. We have to go to the comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:06.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期三是新漫画日 我们必须去漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then we have to stop at Souplantation. It's Creamy Tomato Soup Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再去汤菜园 今天是奶油蕃茄汤之日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And RadioShack. There's a sale on triple-A batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有电器连锁店 七号电池在特价
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:17.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to go to Pottery Barn and return my Star Wars sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:17.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还得去陶艺生活工坊 退我的《星球大战》床单
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一个更好的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna go to Pottery Barn first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要先去陶艺生活工坊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you drive me to Pottery Barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以载我去陶艺生活工坊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:46.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe if I turn off the nightlight, I can keep the sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我把夜灯关了 就可以不用退床单了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's in my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她占了我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:12.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't look at me like that. Everybody knows that's my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:12.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要那样看我 大家都知道那是我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know that we care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我们关心你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:25.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's because we care about you that we've decided we have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:25.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们关心你 所以我们决定要说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're hurting the people around you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你正在伤害你身边的人 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:36.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we made you an appointment, and we want you to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:36.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们帮你预约好了 我们要你拿着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:41.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Department of Motor Vehicles New Driver Handbook"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:41.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“车辆管理局新手使用手册”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我又没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:51.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you need to learn how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:51.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你必须学会如何开车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This madness has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的疯狂行为必须停止
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:57.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's taking you to the DMV. I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:57.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮要带你去车辆管理局 我要去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why Penny? -Because rock breaks scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么是佩妮？ -因为她石头剪子布输了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right. Come on, Sheldon. -Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好了 走吧 谢尔顿 -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:09.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -We have to stop at Pottery Barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:09.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我们要先去陶艺生活工坊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And RadioShack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有电器连锁店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And the comic-book store. PENNY: All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有漫画书店 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna go to the comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢 我也要去漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still don't see why I need a driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不懂为什么我需要驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Albert Einstein never had a driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阿尔伯特爱因斯坦就没有驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:58.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but Albert Einstein didn't make me wet myself at 40 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:58.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是阿尔伯特爱因斯坦不会害我在 时速60公里的时候尿裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and I never wanted to kick Albert Einstein in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀 我从来就不会想要踢 阿尔伯特爱因斯坦的要害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I gotta ask, why didn't you just get a license at 16 like everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 我想要问：“为什么 你不跟大家一样在16岁考驾照呢？”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was otherwise engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在忙别的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Examining perturbative amplitudes in N=4 supersymmetric theories...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检验混乱的振幅 用N=4的超对称理论
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:21.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...leading to a re-examination of the ultraviolet properties...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:21.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导致再次检验紫外线的特性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:25.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of multi-loop N=8 supergravity using modern twistor theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:25.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多元回路N=8超引力 利用现代扭曲理论
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:31.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, how about when you were 17?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:31.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你17岁的时候呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take this to the testing area. Name at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿这个到测验区 把名字写在最上面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sign the bottom, answer the questions, bring it back. Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在最下面签名 回答问题 再交回来 下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Application?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}申请表？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm actually more of a theorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我其实比较像是理论家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The application in your hand. Give it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:54.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你手中的申请表 交给她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take this to the testing area. Name at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿这个到测验区 把名字写在最上面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sign the bottom, answer the questions, bring it back. Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在最下面签名 回答问题 再交回来 下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but I have some concerns about these questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请问一下 我对这些问题有些疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at that sign up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看一下上面的指示牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:13.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes? -Does it say, "I give a damn"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（申请表和学习许可证）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-然后呢？ -上面有说“我在乎”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:18.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -That's because I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:18.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -那是因为我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just look. See, this first question makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 你看 第一个问题讲不通
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, "How many car lengths should you leave in front of you when driving?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看“开车时 应该与前面 保持多少行车距离？”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no possible way to answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这根本就没办法回答
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:31.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A car length is not a standardized unit of measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:31.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行车距离不是一个标准的衡量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at the sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看这指示牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, it's C. Just put down C. -I don't need your help, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 是C 就写C -我不需要你的帮忙 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Listen to that little girl, honey. Put C. Next. SHELDON: No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听她的话 亲爱的 写C 下一位 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:43.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, no, hang on. Take a look at this next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:43.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 不 等一下 看看下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:47.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, why are you arguing with the DMV?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:47.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你为什么要 跟车辆管理局争辩？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How else are they going to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不这样他们怎么学习？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, question two:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 第二个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"When are roadways most slippery?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“什么时候道路最滑？”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are three answers, none of which are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总共有三个选项 没有一个是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The correct answer is, "When covered by liquid sufficient to reduce the coefficient...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正确的答案是“当被足够的液体 覆盖 以减少协同因素
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to static friction between the tire and the road to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}使轮胎与地面的静止摩擦力变成零
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But not so deep as to introduce a new source of friction."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但又不致于产生新的摩擦力来源”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's your learner's permit. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:15.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的学习许可证 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:20.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm not done. I have many additional concerns about these questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:20.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我还没问完 我对这些问题 还有很多其他的疑虑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't make me climb over this counter. -All right, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不要逼我爬出这个柜台 -好了 够了 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}WOMAN: Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aced it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我大获全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:35.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. That's it. Let's boot it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:32.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这样 启动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:36.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Booting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:36.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}启动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a state-of-the-art simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是最先进的模拟器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I adapted it from something a friend designed for the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我修改了一个朋友帮陆军做的设计
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that why I appear to be in Fallujah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是为什么我看来像是在费卢杰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...behind the wheel of an up-armored Humvee?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一台军用装甲悍马车里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't configured it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没设定好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. Bradley tank. Transport truck. Batmobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看有什么 布兰得利坦克 货物运输车、蝙蝠战车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ooh! -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千万不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:02.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go. Red 2006 Ford Taurus on the streets of Pasadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:02.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有了 2006年红色福特托拉斯 在帕萨迪纳市的街道上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:06.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Statistically, red cars...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:06.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -根据统计 红色的车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:08.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...are stopped by police far more often than any other color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:08.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比其他颜色的车容易被警察拦下来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want any hassles with the fuzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想跟警察有任何争论
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, what color do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你要什么颜色？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know the pale blue of Luke Skywalker's lightsaber?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道天行者路克的光剑 发出的淡蓝色吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:23.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before it was digitally remastered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:23.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在用数字方式重新灌制之前的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Black it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就黑色了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:32.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Now, what you wanna do first is turn on the ignition and shift into drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:32.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 现在 你首先要做的是 发动车子然后换成行驶档
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't fastened my seat belt yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没系好我的安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fasten your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 系你的安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡嗒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are there air bags? -You don't need air bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有没有安全气囊？ -你不需要安全气囊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if a simulated van rear-ends me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一模拟货车撞到我的车尾呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:56.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll hit you in the face with a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:56.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会拿枕头打你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ENGINE STARTS ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now shift into drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 现在换成驾驶档
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And pull out slowly into traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后慢慢地开出来 到车流中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:10.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TIRES SCREECHING ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you--? Watch the--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Watch out for the pedestrians! -Oh, God, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心那个…小心路上的行人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GIRL SCREAMS ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hit the brakes! Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢一点 踩刹车…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TIRES SCREECH ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:22.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CAR CRASHES ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CAR CRASHES THEN MAN YELLS ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TIRES SCREECH THEN CAR CRASHES ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TIRES SCREECH THEN GLASS SHATTERS ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Student driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新手驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:51.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did you manage to get on the second floor of the Glendale Galleria?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:51.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是怎么开到购物中心的二楼去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was on the Pasadena Freeway, and missed my exit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来在帕萨迪纳高速公路上 错过了出口
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:59.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...flew off the overpass, and one thing led to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:59.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开下了高架桥 然后就一发不可收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you wanna give it a rest and try again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也许该休息一下 明天再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:09.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CAR CRASHES AND MAN SCREAMS ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CROWD CLAMORING ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:13.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ANIMALS CHIRPING AND WHIMPERING ON SIMULATOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. The pet store?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宠物店
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:22.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remind me to compliment Wolowitz on the software. It's amazingly detailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:22.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提醒我赞美一下沃洛维茨的软件 细节做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So wait. You're just gonna give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以等等 你就这样放弃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我没有放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我从来不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what is it you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你现在在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm, uh, transcending the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正在超越我的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm clearly too evolved for driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很明显 因为我过度进化而不能开车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What does that mean? -Leonard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是什么意思？ -莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:53.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...have you ever wondered why my little toes and lateral incisors...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:53.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有想过为什么 我的小脚趾和侧面的门牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:58.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...are significantly smaller than the average for someone of my size?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:58.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比和我身材一样的普通人小很多？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wonder a lot of things about you, Sheldon, but not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有想过很多关于你的事 谢尔顿 但不是那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, those are indicators...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:08.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I'm farther along the evolutionary scale than the average human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:08.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显示我比一般人类进化的程度更高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No kidding? -Yeah, wait, no, I'm not gonna so far...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-别开玩笑了 -等等 不 我不是要说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:14.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as to say that I represent a distinct new stage in humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:14.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我代表了人类进化的全新阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, a Homo novus, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的 是一个“新人种” 如果你同意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's for anthropologists to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那是由人类学家来认定的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I am convinced that the reason I cannot master...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我确信我不擅长这种
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the plebeian task of driving is because I'm not meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}庸庸碌碌的开车任务 是因为我本来就不该开车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you are. You're meant to learn how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该开车的 你一定要学会开车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Please learn how to drive. -No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拜托你要学会开车 -不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:38.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm meant for greater things, like unraveling the mysteries of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:38.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我注定要做更伟大的事 像是解开宇宙的奥秘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:43.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...not determining when it's safe to pass a stopped school bus on a country road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:43.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而不是决定什么时候才能 在乡村道路上安全绕过校车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's never safe. -Yeah, well, I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-永远都不安全 -是的 我现在知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Assuming that everything you say is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 就算你所说的都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:55.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how does the biologically superior Homo novus get to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:55.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请问生理上高度进化的 “新人种”明天上午…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么去上班？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:00.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Homo novus doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:00.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“新人种”并不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坚持下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you'll evolve into something with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许你会进化出翅膀来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Good morning, gentlemen. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早安 各位 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there some new kind of Casual Friday I don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}休闲星期五有什么新花样 是我不知道的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:27.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he lives here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:27.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是的 他现在住这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, since he won't take the bus and he's too evolved to drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他不搭公车 加上他过度进化 不能开车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:34.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he decided to sleep in his office...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:34.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以干脆决定睡在办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and shower in the radiation lab until I'm finished with my experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在激光实验室洗澡 直到我完成实验
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you finished your experiment a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你一星期前就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:19:00.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:59.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（我的天啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（又出现了？）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（一定是老鼠）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（老鼠不会做吐司）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（还把面包皮切掉）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LOUD BANGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.07,0:19:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You saw nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
